{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":13,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-6","storyName":"大人物","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"打捞港都中心城区当晚，瓦列里奥为德·托莱多求来了点亮海图的机会。另一边，审判庭开展针对奥卢斯的抓捕行动。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_06_beg","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":11,"next":13,"characters":["城镇居民A","城镇居民B","城镇居民C","城镇居民D","干练的船工","热情的船工","特菲","瓦列里奥","斐戴拉","惩戒军士兵","惩戒军士官","艾丽妮","南多","德鲁莎","纳乔","克莱门莎"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdtalk_fear","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":8},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"-50,0","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"l","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民A","text":"嘿，那边的小伙子，来点海藻酒吗？","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民B","text":"我们必须要保持洁净，酒会使人堕落，它——","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民A","text":"什么日子办什么事儿嘛。估摸着也是为了庆祝港都中心城区升起，那边的惩戒军刚才都来光顾我的生意了。","id":19},{"type":"dialog","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_178","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"-10,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民B","text":"……好吧，我只喝一点点，要是醉昏了头，就看不清海图上的坐标了。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_178.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","volume":"1","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民A","text":"到时候你还看什么坐标啊！再过两个小时，港都的中心城区就会直接在你眼前升起来！","id":30},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":31},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"charslot","id":33},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_460_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_462_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民C","text":"来看看，那位阿戈尔监事留在这儿的海图。他们说港都的坐标已经在上面了。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_460_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民D","text":"中心城区……你能想象那地方长什么样吗？真要是住在那里面，得是什么感受？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_462_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民C","text":"听说那里有些房子，就连砖缝都是用金粉勾的。那样的话，是不是一点都不会漏风？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_460_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民C","text":"你能想象吗，不会被海风吹透的房子？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_460_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民D","text":"……我是在草棚里长大的啊。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_462_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民D","text":"我甚至都没想过有一天自己会看着与阿戈尔相连的海图，在上面找那些只有老一辈人提过的名字。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_462_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民C","text":"那都是伊比利亚曾经的城市啊……圣徒在上，居然真有那么多。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_460_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民C","text":"喏，你看，港都的坐标在那儿！它还是灰色的。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_460_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民D","text":"两个小时之后，它就要被点亮了吧？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_462_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民C","text":"船厂的工人们今夜一定会很忙，不知道哪个伊比利亚人能获此殊荣，亲手点亮一座静默了六十三年的宏伟都城。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_460_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"城镇居民D","text":"大概是哪位深受圣徒阁下信任的大审判官吧。这个时间，他们应该已经在准备了。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_462_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":61},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"干练的船工","text":"还有两个小时。起重机那边已经一切就位了，你的船检查得怎么样了？","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的船工","text":"没有问题！像斐戴拉大审判官嘱咐的那样，要是起重机出了故障，随时有船可以出海检修设备！","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"干练的船工","text":"那就再测试一遍通讯稳定性，一旦我们给出信号，打捞中心的操作员就会启动程序，正式开始打捞了。","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的船工","text":"明白！等等，我们还没有获得通讯系统的授权？","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"干练的船工","text":"权限应该在半小时前就开通了啊？去找找斐戴拉大审判官！","id":75},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":76},{"type":"dialog","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_bg_27_g25_goldenboat_core.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$farce_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_farce_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":85,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","posfrom":"-120,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"1","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#11$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"我们进来了，我们就这么进来了？这可是整个港都的中控室啊！","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"-100,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.2","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"这地上、墙上，不会真的都是金子吧？这么大的炉子，是港都的动力源？快过来看，还有这个……","id":94},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#2$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"瓦列里奥，你光盯着那个黑乎乎的大铁匣子看什么？","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"导航、动力、通讯——港都作为移动城市的几乎所有功能，都是这个大铁匣子里的东西在维系着。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#15$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"那里面好像有什么东西在动——","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"可别碰它，斐戴拉大审判官会怪罪我们的。","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#1$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"这些都是那个大审判官告诉你的吗？你向她保证了什么，她才同意让我们进来啊？","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#7$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"她之前拒绝我，可是毫不留情啊！","id":109},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#2$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"斐戴拉大审判官需要坚守自己的职责，让她启动海图系统，是卡门阁下的直接命令。","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#10$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"那你这次又是怎么搞定的，快给我讲讲！我嘴皮子都磨破了，她就像没听见似的！","id":114},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":120},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":123},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":124,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你们回去巡逻吧，切记，不能让任何闲杂人等靠近中控室，那是整个港都的心脏。","id":126},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"charslot","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士兵","text":"是！","id":131},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"点亮海图……她根本不知道那个光点意味着什么，更不知道审判庭要付出什么，就连我也……","id":140},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"谁在那里！","id":146},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"抱歉，大审判官阁下，是我。","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"不用说了。","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"从我们认识到现在不过一两周，你替埃斯特菲尼娅求情多少次了？我应当辞退她，还你我一个清净。","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#11$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我明白，您也听厌了我讲她的事。所以，我这次来，是想跟您讲讲我自己。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"你？","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#9$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"在遇到特菲之前，我也在伊比利亚的各处流浪。我身上的伤是为救一个朋友留下的，在咸涩的海风里，它迟迟没有愈合。","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#5$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"疼痛让我无法入眠，每个宵禁的夜晚，我只能思考，思考我为何沦落到这个地步，思考伊比利亚的一切。","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"直到我在酒馆里遇到这个唱船歌的黎博利，我一眼就能看出她靠欺骗为生，但她用自己的钱给我买了食物。","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"之后，我与她一起流浪，她用那套贵族的说辞骗了很多人，也救下了很多人。","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#12$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"她好像真的把自己当作了黄金时代的贵族，她想保护所有拥护者，甚至实现他们的愿望——包括我的，所以我们才来到这里。","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"而这次，她向你提出不知天高地厚的要求，也只是为了再救一个人。","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2270_1#1$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斐戴拉","text":"……","id":172},{"type":"dialog","id":173},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_bg_27_g25_goldenboat_core.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":178},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#4$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"……怪不得她能让你也跟我一起进来。你看，虽然死板得要命，但真诚的故事和经历还是可以打动她的。","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#5$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"要我说，我们这回点亮了坐标，真成了像样的“大人物”之后，就该去出书立传，给所有人讲故事。我口述，你写。","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"……","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#15$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"怎么啦？你怎么不说话了？我还想知道是你的哪段经历那么感人，能打动那位石头似的大审判官呢。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"我还有哪段经历，是你不知道的呢？","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"既然大审判官阁下把这份重任交到了我们手上，我们就绝不能耽搁一秒。故事，就等回去再讲吧？","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#10$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"喔喔，那当然好！","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_393_toledo_1#13$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"不过，我们是不是应该向斐戴拉大审判官确认一下操作流程？点亮海图这事儿还是太大了……","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"不用担心，很快斐戴拉大审判官就会来的。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2266_1#4$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"继续吧，只要能恢复海图系统的功能，一切都会如你所愿的。","id":201},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":202},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"charslot","id":206},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_act17side_02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act17side/m_bat_act17side_02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":211,"musicid":3},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":212},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","isblock":"true","id":221},{"type":"charslot","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2277_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"自首的那个岛民没说假话，这三天我们已经确认了袭击案嫌犯的据点。为了避免惊扰敌人，暂时还没有实施任何抓捕行动。","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"那些人多是伤员，士气低落，但他们的组织者非常谨慎，直到今早才露面。也是因此，我们才能确认据点的位置无误。","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"今晚，港都中心城区会回归伊比利亚的海岸线，而那些阴魂不散的邪教徒，也会受到审判。","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惩戒军士官","text":"艾丽妮，圣徒阁下还有什么指示吗？","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"卡门阁下不会亲自参与抓捕，但他给出了明确的指示——","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"如果敌人已是深渊的俘虏，他们的尸骨甚至不配被扔进大海；但若他们只是迷茫的同胞，就用灯火指引他们上岸。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#4$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"列队！出发！","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"1","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"120,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2276_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"120,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","posfrom":"-120,0","posto":"30,0","duration":"1.5","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#1$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"教官！","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"我把耳朵塞好了，你说吧。","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"您才休养了几天？伤口都还在渗血！","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"要我躺在自己乱七八糟、气味难闻的屋子里，看着你们从窗口经过，去抓我查了这么久的幕后黑手——","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"我伤口就要气裂了。","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"您在说谎，教官。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"如果您在完全能合理偷懒的情况下选择行动，那就意味着您觉得这次任务一定有问题。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"呵，难得机灵。","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"事情……这么严重？","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"我没证据，你就先当是一个失血过多的伤员在胡言乱语吧。","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"不论那位主教能变出多少只恐鱼，他都只有一张嘴能用来指挥人。对于一个要躲在暗处的人来说，那张嘴还不太方便说话。","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"我不相信他仅凭自己就能那么手眼通天，指挥那些邪教徒和岛民完成那样精准的袭击计划。","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"您怀疑他还有帮手？","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"希望是我想多了。","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"保护好自己，别死在伊比利亚几十年难遇的大日子里。","id":277},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":278},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_bg_32_RL2_cliffnight.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":285},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":288},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$chenandwei_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14d0d0/m_avg_chenandwei_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":289,"musicid":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"克莱门莎监事？您应该在广场参加迎回雷亚-伊比利亚的庆典，怎么在这儿……","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"奥卢斯的计划很有可能还在继续，为了避免横生事端，惩戒军今晚就会开始抓捕行动。","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"今晚？那我的同胞们——","id":298},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我已经与伊比利亚阁下达成了些许共识。所有岛民都有机会离开这里，去往阿戈尔生活。","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"但不是现在。","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"阿戈尔有权迁移同胞，但无权干涉今晚的抓捕行动。","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"如果这场抓捕和后续的审判因我的干涉而生变，我不确定伊比利亚会不会发生更大的动乱。","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你的同胞被逮捕之后还需在审判庭度过一段日子，不过，你可以在弥利亚留姆等你的朋友们受审结束。","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……在弥利亚留姆？","id":311},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":312},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你从来没有直接造成过任何破坏和伤亡，参与袭击也只是被迫卷入其中。况且，你的证言也准确有效。","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我与伊比利亚阁下商议的结果是，你可以成为第一个迁回阿戈尔的岛民。","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……我跟您说过吗，克莱门莎监事？","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"截肢之后，我很痛苦也很沮丧。理智告诉我邻居的报复情有可原，感性又阻拦我对奶奶宣泄情绪。","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"所以我做了一件在阿奎拉他们看来很蠢的事——我试图融入伊比利亚人，向他们证明岛民也可以和伊比利亚人好好相处。","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我能背诵每一部经书，也从未缺席过一场礼拜，哪怕我认得出向我家窗户扔燃烧瓶的邻居是哪几个，我也会对他们微笑。","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"直到有一天我被镇上的证裁官喊去担任辅祭——","id":327},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#15$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"据我的了解，这样的举动几乎可以代表伊比利亚对你的认可。","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"是啊，我高兴得几乎要哭出来。","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"但我很快就发现，我感到欣喜，不是因为辅祭是多了不得的差事，只是因为大多岛民这辈子都无法获得这份“认可”，仅此而已。","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我为自己的欣喜感到羞耻。","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"追求更好的生活并不可耻。","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我明白，但我无法回到阿戈尔这件事已成定局。","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":341},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":342},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"纳乔抬起自己的右手，黄金时代工匠的手笔，包括失而复得的那枚螺栓，浑然一体，流畅地运转着。","id":345},{"type":"text","text":"但透明的外壳下，独属于海嗣的触肢在隐蔽的角落里跳动着，是它们维持着假肢的稳定，缓解使用者的痛苦。","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我接受了奥卢斯先生的手术。如果不是那场手术，我没法从袭击现场救回那么多同胞，我不后悔。","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"纳乔……","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"我明白了。我撤回提前将你迁回阿戈尔的提议。","id":352},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"但不是因为你接受了那场手术，而是出于你接受它的那个原因。","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"既然你接受手术，本就是为了能救回更多岛民，那我想，你今晚一定也会需要做同样的事。","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"嗯。虽然有您担保，但既然是抓捕行动，今晚一定还会有人反抗，会有人受伤。","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我得在场，我得帮忙。","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"那我会竭力保障你自由行动的权利，今晚，没有人能因那些海嗣触肢给你定罪。","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"而等到你真正被海嗣同化的那一刻，我也一定会亲手给你解脱。","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"background","id":372},{"type":"image","id":373}],"characters":["城镇居民A","城镇居民B","城镇居民C","城镇居民D","干练的船工","热情的船工","特菲","瓦列里奥","斐戴拉","惩戒军士兵","惩戒军士官","艾丽妮","南多","德鲁莎","纳乔","克莱门莎"]}